      "text": "CI-2 Build\nnpm ci (incl. devDeps)\nWrite runtime .env (JWT, Mongo, BASE_URL, GITHUB_RELEASE_REPO, ...)\nnext build (raised Node heap)\nDelete .next/cache (do not ship)\nOptional: verify production npm ci lockfile parity",
