      "seed": 86093710,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 62375746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "END-TO-END COMMERCIAL FLOW\n1. Maintainer runs CI -> GitHub Release (tarball + chunks) on channel repo\n2. Super-admin creates Client (email) in License Admin dashboard\n3. Customer VM: installer collects email + machineCode\n4. POST /api/license/register (client must already exist) -> License bound | key generated (HMAC)\n5. Install/update: POST /api/license/validate (email+machine+version+channel)\n    -> checks client active, license not revoked, records ValidationHistory, may return asset pointer\n6. GET /api/asset/download/meta then download parts OR full tarball (authorizeAssetDownload -> validateLicense)\n    -> stream from local RELEASE_ASSETS_DIR cache OR GitHub asset API\n7. Optional cron/sync-releases keeps local cache warm\n8. Day-2: revoke / toggle client or license -> future validate/download fails; version/list still catalogs releases\n9. In-app updates: version/list (+ installer --update / --schedule-update) still require valid entitlement on gated path",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "END-TO-END COMMERCIAL FLOW\n1. Maintainer runs CI -> GitHub Release (tarball + chunks) on channel repo\n2. Super-admin creates Client (email) in License Admin dashboard\n3. Customer VM: installer collects email + machineCode\n4. POST /api/license/register (client must already exist) -> License bound | key generated (HMAC)\n5. Install/update: POST /api/license/validate (email+machine+version+channel)\n    -> checks client active, license not revoked, records ValidationHistory, may return asset pointer\n6. GET /api/asset/download/meta then download parts OR full tarball (authorizeAssetDownload -> validateLicense)\n    -> stream from local RELEASE_ASSETS_DIR cache OR GitHub asset API\n7. Optional cron/sync-releases keeps local cache warm\n8. Day-2: revoke / toggle client or license -> future validate/download fails; version/list still catalogs releases\n9. In-app updates: version/list (+ installer --update / --schedule-update) still require valid entitlement on gated path",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
